   "widgets_values": [
    "# 05 \u2014 Automated Production (optional, combined pipeline)\n\nPrompt -> Krea candidate -> save -> **[optional] GPT refine** -> save final -> **[optional] Seedance video** -> save video.\n\n## Cost-control toggles (obvious controls, per your brief)\n\nThe two expensive stages are **disabled by default** using ComfyUI's node Mode (the same mechanism official ComfyUI templates use for optional branches):\n\n- **[ Use GPT refinement: OFF ]** \u2014 the GPT Image 2.5 node below is set to *Never* (right-click it -> Mode -> Always to turn ON). While off, its Krea input passes straight through unmodified, so 'final image' downstream is just the Krea candidate.\n- **[ Generate video: OFF ]** \u2014 the Seedance node AND its Save & Log Video node are both set to *Never*. Turn ON both together (right-click each -> Mode -> Always) \u2014 video has no image passthrough, so only the Save node would error if left on its own.\n\nKrea generation itself always runs when you Queue (it's the cheap, high-volume stage)."
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
